The call sequence after `unmount()` is `["node"]` — one call, with the node. In other words, within this file, **even after `unmount()`, the ref hasn't been detached at all**. However, in the probe file, the sequence was `node, null`.

So the difference is at the file level. What's in slot.test.tsx but not in the probe?

